# Goal: design and implement the Auth System(as well as the basic security system)

1. Design a authentication and authorization system based on the passport.js(authentication), and a simple version of authorization using the example provided in the Nestjs doc.
2. Only Email / Password login is supported.
3. Session will be persisted using JWT.
4. 4 types of user for authorization: guest, user, admin, agent.
5. This design has to be a simple but production grade system design. This is the first version, it should be simple, clean and reliable.
6. Design the schemas as well.

